    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet within the secure and well-maintained Carleton Wharf development, this beautifully presented two-bedroom first-floor apartment enjoys a superb south-facing position with stunning views across Youghal Bay.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and spacious throughout, featuring an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with direct access to a private balcony, creating the perfect space to relax and take in the coastal scenery. The property comprises two generous double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition, the apartment is ready for immediate occupation and will appeal to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, investors or anyone seeking a low-maintenance holiday home by the sea."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nBedroom 1 - 3.96m x 3.05m\nCarpet Flooring. Double Room. En-Suite\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.38m x 3.68m\nCarpet Flooring. Double Room.\n\nBathroom - 2.18m x 1.63m\nTile Flooring. Bath. Shower. Wash Hand Basin. Toilet.\n\nKitchen Dining living - 7.75m x 4.06m\nTile Flooring in Kitchen/Dining. Timber Laminate in Liiving.\n\nBalcony - \n\n\n"
      },
